      "requirement": "Preserve Sulivan’s observed Falkland vegetation, probable storm damage, recalled distances and bird loss separately from his explicit uncertainty about seeds versus dust. Keep Darwin’s brown-crayon scores, inserted words and portfolio mark as later undated annotations, not Sulivan prose or dated knowledge.",
